== budget (uplink-governor §4.2), 1000 B/s: burst 2000, window 30000
admits 1500 at 0: true
admits 1000 at 0: false, waits 0.50s
admits 1000 at 0.5: true
a body over the bucket alone: true
then the window blocks: waits until a completion
after its completion, debt paid by 100s: true
== gate at 1 MiB/s
4 MiB in 512 KiB bodies: about 2 s (the burst is 2 s of rate)
a best-effort body beyond the budget: refused
an unlimited link admits at once: true
